        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202570/extras/c31be8870abc28d1e1d3a41484154e1e.avif?t=1767175125\" alt=\"Iris and Elicia pose together for the camera, their faces close as they smile gently.\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iris, a 31-year-old office worker with eight years of experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she meets Gregory, a mysterious magical girl, and decides to become a magical girl herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven visual novel</strong>: Experience immersive gameplay through dialogue and carefully crafted storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single main storyline</strong>: Follow a cohesive narrative centered on Iris, and witness her choices and emotional journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sub-story content</strong>: Enjoy short sub-stories and unlock additional illustrations in the gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality visuals</strong>: Experience a vivid world brought to life with detailed CGs and charming visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appealing characters</strong>: Meet three unique magical girls, the Demon King, and adorable animal characters, each with their own distinct charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202570/extras/2082834ee544f4eccd7e8da3b7ed87ca.avif?t=1767175125\" alt=\"Iris, a blonde female character, sits at her office desk and looks toward the viewer with an uninterested expression.\" width=600 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Killing Magician』 is a text adventure where you experience the extraordinary daily life of Iris, a magical girl worn down by the world and stripped of all innocence, together with Elysia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this brutal world where dark secrets lurk,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can Iris save the Earth from a giant tuna?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202570/extras/c31be8870abc28d1e1d3a41484154e1e.avif?t=1767175125\" alt=\"Iris and Elicia pose together for the camera, their faces close as they smile gently.\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iris, a 31-year-old office worker with eight years of experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she meets Gregory, a mysterious magical girl, and decides to become a magical girl herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven visual novel</strong>: Experience immersive gameplay through dialogue and carefully crafted storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single main storyline</strong>: Follow a cohesive narrative centered on Iris, and witness her choices and emotional journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sub-story content</strong>: Enjoy short sub-stories and unlock additional illustrations in the gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality visuals</strong>: Experience a vivid world brought to life with detailed CGs and charming visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appealing characters</strong>: Meet three unique magical girls, the Demon King, and adorable animal characters, each with their own distinct charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202570/extras/2082834ee544f4eccd7e8da3b7ed87ca.avif?t=1767175125\" alt=\"Iris, a blonde female character, sits at her office desk and looks toward the viewer with an uninterested expression.\" width=600 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Killing Magician』 is a text adventure where you experience the extraordinary daily life of Iris, a magical girl worn down by the world and stripped of all innocence, together with Elysia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this brutal world where dark secrets lurk,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can Iris save the Earth from a giant tuna?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
